{"unit_id":"EPCN-fla__dsh-custom-headers#card-zh","repo":"EPCN-fla/dsh-custom-headers","commit":"516991507d2c2df29b9aa04a6d665d974bbd0714","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Custom Headers 是面向 DSH Web 的请求头配置插件。它在插件配置界面提供命名请求头配置，并把配置选择器加入模型目录的各个模型行；运行时仅对支持的 pi-ai 模型调用应用所选请求头。用户可以创建和编辑多组请求头配置、为不同模型分别选择配置，并在下一次调用时生效；校验会处理重复名称和不可表示的请求头。适合需要按模型设置网关或服务请求头的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:251","src/client/index.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"EPCN-fla__dsh-custom-headers#card-en","repo":"EPCN-fla/dsh-custom-headers","commit":"516991507d2c2df29b9aa04a6d665d974bbd0714","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Custom Headers adds reusable header profiles to DSH Web and a selector to each model row. It applies the selected profile to supported pi-ai requests at call time, so models can use distinct gateway headers. The editor validates profiles before saving.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:251","src/client/index.ts:18"]}
