{"unit_id":"EPCN-fla__dsh-custom-headers#feature-profile","repo":"EPCN-fla/dsh-custom-headers","commit":"516991507d2c2df29b9aa04a6d665d974bbd0714","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Custom Headers 的功能「命名请求头配置」：在插件配置卡片中创建多个配置，每个配置包含名称和请求头键值行；可编辑、添加或删除配置与请求头，再保存更改。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/HeadersCard.tsx:170","src/client/HeadersCard.tsx:317"]}
